# node-dependencies.allowlist — one package per line (exact names from package.json keys).
# CI gate: scripts/check_node_deps.py diffs apps/dashboard/package.json dependencies +
# devDependencies against this file and exits non-zero on any un-allowlisted package.
# Adding a package = PR that edits this file with justification in the commit body.
# Baseline generated from apps/dashboard/package.json on 2026-06-11.

